### 4. Running Existing GitHub Workflows
After pushing to `main`, the `Deploy Site` workflow will auto-trigger. To manually re-run it:

```bash
# Via GitHub CLI (requires gh auth login first)
gh run list --workflow=Deploy\ Site
gh run rerun --latest

# Or via the GitHub web UI:
# Repository → Actions → Deploy Site → Run workflow
```

